273
00:13:58.000 --> 00:13:59.480
You could write them yourself.

274
00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:03.560
You want to have a prompt that runs through like build this thing.

275
00:14:03.560 --> 00:14:05.400
Here are the requirements.

276
00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:09.280
It should require using the context or at least should require

277
00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:11.440
doing what the context says. Right.

