00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:44.480
Like very granular things that can then be checked at the end of the solution

291
00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:47.480
to see what's good code written.

292
00:14:47.560 --> 00:14:50.720
And an important thing to note is that once you have these in place,

293
00:14:50.720 --> 00:14:52.480
like this can take a bit of upfront work.

